4. Dependencies

npm packages included in the build output, including fonts, are licensed
under their own licenses.

The website built from this repository lists these packages, with their
license texts and copyright notices, in /third-party-licenses.txt. The list
is generated at build time by scripts/third-party-licenses.mjs.

