outlines of LINE Seed JP Bold (© LY Corporation) from the npm package
@fontsource/line-seed-jp, by scripts/generate-logotype.mjs. The font is
under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. The full text, with the copyright
notice, is in LICENSES/OFL-1.1.txt.
